Use MappedFile for mmap-related operations in CursorWindow

Upstream: platform/frameworks/base commit e28dd9f756f

Why: the official CursorWindow is 8 bytes larger after mSize: the row count is
at 0x40 against 0x38 in r1, which is the mMappedFile member.

